   "text": "Square: the pseudonode of LAN1. Each member reaches it at 10,\nand it reaches each member at 0.",
   "originalText": "Square: the pseudonode of LAN1. Each member reaches it at 10,\nand it reaches each member at 0.",
   "fontSize": 16,
