   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "How it works: point-to-point maths, with a fate group",
   "originalText": "How it works: point-to-point maths, with a fate group",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a21-text-11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 54,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1152019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Model",
   "originalText": "Model",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a21-text-12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 200,
   "width": 762,
   "height": 22,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 95028,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1256748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Each pair of members gets a link LAN1:A-B. A → pseudonode → B costs m_A + 0, so:",
   "originalText": "Each pair of members gets a link LAN1:A-B. A → pseudonode → B costs m_A + 0, so:",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a21-text-13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 232,
   "width": 509,
   "height": 40,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 102947,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1361477,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "c(A,B) = m_A      c(B,A) = m_B\nLAN1:R2-R3, LAN1:R2-R4, LAN1:R3-R4, each 10 both ways",
   "originalText": "c(A,B) = m_A      c(B,A) = m_B\nLAN1:R2-R3, LAN1:R2-R4, LAN1:R3-R4, each 10 both ways",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a21-text-14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 282,
   "width": 972,
   "height": 43,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 110866,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1466206,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Distances, first hops and ECMP are the pseudonode’s exactly, and no fake router enters any space, path\nor label stack. Adj-SIDs are per neighbor on the LAN (LAN-Adj-SIDs).",
   "originalText": "Distances, first hops and ECMP are the pseudonode’s exactly, and no fake router enters any space, path\nor label stack. Adj-SIDs are per neighbor on the LAN (LAN-Adj-SIDs).",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a21-text-15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 335,
   "width": 447,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 118785,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1570935,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "What fails: S’s whole interface to the LAN",
   "originalText": "What fails: S’s whole interface to the LAN",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a21-text-16",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 369,
   "width": 953,
   "height": 43,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 126704,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1675664,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Protecting LAN1:R2-R4 means R2’s interface fails, so its other LAN links fail too: the fate group is\n{LAN1:R2-R3}.",
   "originalText": "Protecting LAN1:R2-R4 means R2’s interface fails, so its other LAN links fail too: the fate group is\n{LAN1:R2-R3}.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a21-text-17",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 422,
   "width": 953,
   "height": 149,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 134623,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1780393,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  LFA: a candidate over the same LAN is skipped (reason same-lan, RFC 5286 §3.6). A candidate’s own\n   path may cross the LAN between other members.\n•  ECMP: another next hop on the same LAN is no protector.\n•  Remote LFA: P(S) also needs S’s path to avoid its other LAN links, which are never a tunnel exit.\n   Q-space is unchanged.\n•  TI-LFA: the post-convergence SPF removes the whole interface, and every segment must avoid it, as\n   for an SRLG (A19).",
   "originalText": "•  LFA: a candidate over the same LAN is skipped (reason same-lan, RFC 5286 §3.6). A candidate’s own\n   path may cross the LAN between other members.\n•  ECMP: another next hop on the same LAN is no protector.\n•  Remote LFA: P(S) also needs S’s path to avoid its other LAN links, which are never a tunnel exit.\n   Q-space is unchanged.\n•  TI-LFA: the post-convergence SPF removes the whole interface, and every segment must avoid it, as\n   for an SRLG (A19).",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a21-text-18",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 581,
   "width": 245,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 142542,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1885122,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "R2 → R4: the candidates",
   "originalText": "R2 → R4: the candidates",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a21-text-19",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 615,
   "width": 790,
   "height": 53,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 150461,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1989851,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "R3 over LAN1:R2-R3   skipped: same LAN as the protected link (as plain links it would win: 20)\nR1 over R1–R2        dist(R1,R4)=20 < dist(R1,R2)+dist(R2,R4) = 10+10 = 20 ✗  (tie)\nR3 over R2–R3        dist(R3,R4)=10 < dist(R3,R2)+dist(R2,R4) = 10+10 = 20 ✓  cost 15+10 = 25",
   "originalText": "R3 over LAN1:R2-R3   skipped: same LAN as the protected link (as plain links it would win: 20)\nR1 over R1–R2        dist(R1,R4)=20 < dist(R1,R2)+dist(R2,R4) = 10+10 = 20 ✗  (tie)\nR3 over R2–R3        dist(R3,R4)=10 < dist(R3,R2)+dist(R2,R4) = 10+10 = 20 ✓  cost 15+10 = 25",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
